/// True for a path under the LSA SECURITY hive or the SAM hive (`\Registry\Machine\SECURITY[...]` or
/// `\Registry\Machine\SAM[...]`) — lsass' LsapOpenServiceKey / samsrv's SampInitDatabase open these,
